# Makes pText safe to use as a file or folder name: letters, digits,
# dash and underscore survive, everything else becomes an underscore.
# cLogTitle is free text and goes into a path, so it has to pass here.
# Returns the cleaned text.
Calculate out as ''
For n from 1 to len(pText) step 1
	Calculate ch as mid(pText,n,1)
	If pos(low(ch),'abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789-_')
		Calculate out as con(out,ch)
	Else
		Calculate out as con(out,'_')
	End If
End For
Quit method out